# Cotonou Agreement Expiration and Successor Deadline

This scope checks the relationship between the expiration of the Cotonou trade preferences and the required deadline for a WTO compatible successor trade arrangement.

```catala
declaration scope CotonouExpirationCheck:
  input cotonou_expiry_date content date
  input successor_deadline content date
  output successor_required content boolean
```

The successor trade arrangement must be in place by the deadline following the expiration of the Cotonou trade preferences.

```catala
scope CotonouExpirationCheck:
  date round down
  definition successor_required equals
    (cotonou_expiry_date < successor_deadline)
```